{"catch":"這是什麼時代？世界史時代判定 4 選 1 益智測驗！","desc":"「這是哪個時代？」從事件、人物、文化、戰爭、發明等線索出發，用 4 選 1 猜出正確的歷史時代。\n\n從古代到近代，題目短小好上手，讓你把零散的知識重新排進時間軸，逐步建立世界史的脈絡感。\n\n答錯也不怕，隨時回顧重練、補強弱點。適合通勤碎片時間、日常刷題與考前複習。","publisher":"TT","release":"2026-04-09","genres":["工具"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (繁體字)"],"size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a79e17a5090b50a9205ecb82330afaa917eed1e551999f74f8d75d0f0904186f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e32d841292cb978ae605aaa7e759bc64b269f5c87fc49c1c6c76b3e7e5c8394.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c83d4f3cce253a640d33c1dbdecaf86fb6034560fb97b47bafe1445fe32b2115.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b678c05e61d4aa8a88aa0865d3a881cd64c8728ee5670dd77228355e9500794.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/990411369a9735c30b8b2e6d0349275f6c89a5cc5bd92e963c3175c9ce6eb8fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4230fb1b07801086588f3e790b28fd1e03f2b1eeca46de29a3d866a81fa03d86.jpg"]}